1. Create a 390 x 844 mobile frame set with five screens: Home, Network, Quick Settings, Data Usage and Call.
2. Home: status bar with signal strength, network type and battery, and shortcut tiles.
3. Network: toggle switches for mobile data, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and airplane mode, and a manual network selection list.
4. Quick Settings: auto-connect, hotspot, data saver and do-not-disturb as toggle components.
5. Data Usage: a bar chart of daily usage with a monthly limit.
6. Call screen: dial pad, contacts shortcut and a call-over-Wi-Fi option.
7. Build a Toggle component with On/Off variants, connect the screens with Navigate to and test the flow in Present mode.
